            %h4#WZWTermOfChiralPerturbationTheoryReferencesIncludingElectroweakInteractions Including electroweak interactions
            %p
              Including
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electroweak+fields"} electroweak fields
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  J. Bijnens, G. Ecker, A. Picha,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em The chiral anomaly in non-leptonic weak interactions
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(92)91785-8"} doi:10.1016/0370-2693(92)91785-8
