          %h3#relation_to_instantons_calorons_solitons_monopoles Relation to instantons, calorons, solitons, monopoles
          %p
            The construction of Skyrmions from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#AtiyahManton89
